 ## Keep identity and formulation approval separate
 
 Once the material and its evidence are agreed, formulation approval still needs its own project-specific criteria. Our recommendation is to compare the candidate sample in the intended base and process, defining the colour, aroma, taste, dispersion and stability outcomes that matter for that product. Do not infer those outcomes from an authenticity result.
 
